Zero point energy                ...      0.08628377 Eh      54.14 kcal/mol
Thermal vibrational correction   ...      0.00316202 Eh       1.98 kcal/mol
Thermal rotational correction    ...      0.00141627 Eh       0.89 kcal/mol
